  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/221430a2a7e16328dc8dfd7889b1bc64fb8938f4bd9ac4fed35f6f90cb2a49cc24df119eebf366bd7bc7e2608a26d07fccc525cabdbb6c963ce4d552c77cb31f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4d56a0c5a7d4aa7e6ce45e021f55d4a143100abdf949f338bbef320a9207e43d3eda2da8a6cd8d6b60d45cd97ab55c6696f599459721678837847569171c893742d494b6de16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bb626e76080f26441f4f49f6bd027cafe2c2ee581899db41e08af212a765d20c723ca5773f174b29152e8dcd1bbe593cd556fe338e400cd9c27f31d69021dcb7add7f2b92404c1120aa4405c110e06c083994609dbeec6637fb906ddf1b8113a7cb85d14f444f42901ca918c41675cfc43094aadd58e1459\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/54bc1e8917bd8ed0c654de33ad6c668abf94d715187fdae490b558e37511a738eebdb90b12f0cd540f3ad89364f9d2642deb61843c2828e243f24442c5641cae6b59846a97681190fe65a455e4c68894d075b185fc720bd324f6a75542996c8b59eeb65f341e00a3b5ccfc604667f2be2f0eb73f2cc65252\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1f25cfcb0b6e5a1cc4b191d2e8e852058b05b30d7fb592059ed29adf0f45c57dd501d6b9c27dfe2b65a061e58248e31175ab869ecafb431bcfd061fade4395983314dfdf51038d35d4112b66e52ec05e512676ed869d57b64d8c3fbbf71039248d9651202e585b1b1bd22a7b0396e47a6bb98b8ffecd55f7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9bba493b3e22c7078ba88335c9c9c9aea7c211fcfcb13bd6b8300016febb1ea6deb378b12a8ffdbbe2b20697a71865a322d1506ef02fdda9c8d004272b0e0f7a0393f2b2de2fb7e82c56123d7d2ba71cf0a9aa4a58a327447dc292993561c0f7c2efa804c62e7bba369b2ee904e0ce7c4526ccb1774bc03a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bb54360e473200f2007018a54ecd30cc2aad770e6f8c32e40d3a28c75573a4b5564fc0375ad3be181cc7a1e04765c1583d8e95a99b315d21def8322a7c7b01dd9078c1b845e443870e731f901667e34c737115f942f6659e95f623fc3dc12be07c99a4bd0ae524875676ba00539f7d10057e85298cb3b7ba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/7d7aa59d7b8a7e8b3feccaf1421aad1905528fcc5332efac396838ea20dd076b4ae9cc096d0317dd1e9662d3d3e700e4d35044\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/53e20a1d4d1c79146d69b40b6d0a76fc5d861d20334546ac70a3eb9538126db80ef54583e394b3bf3f706b65acabdc3af114199bbc977241bfaa568995ba308ff91b57561d873b755f1fb42c5468746de625f8dc0897c17e95744098cfbd6ea470f3396495822a3cce5be313d0b6860938c80022d0f7221e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a006b734591b33e6f66ff19dcc514448cc58b622f012f5dc7751b229284b82ecf94cdda3e8418faf8fb634c70ad81418448d512320f936a98bd5b7c044a285d6f54923b7784a9f219fbcfcfe3d9a14592d67c24d112e1d6fa6634701d2a7733e28df876589fd3920223cf0b8ff470dba2393ac7c4b7b5a20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/851b11a6d5d6331ec911437d8cefabd15197df1ca2f523f29213c458f615054362e94422b2d4ea3cf3b9a1544e313a282616d538ea8b1ec2d66f048caa2ba7f208b9ad51fcbf2f67079ae06fdcfdfadfc2d72475923dc1bcd9a6fe1912aba6cd056628d400c37cb46fe281ff32b7588232b319bb8f3ab259\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b5d1bad213155b49a279a15bcdcdbb5a65a6f6d0723ff1093e9712b685d72328c432375e896d6dd2c6c993b3a8d02a3fa4cd8aba24077f92c6ad94b02464165e3b596016e179ce2a35545789e9d6726fe326daf321190ff019655f5de4ef3bdb908c0e0ac7c4eb1d52b8d51c6876d0c53a3076ead245dcaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/80c6d061eba50be6c432a7a1b06923e10119c98b9e4a8a7336a760f818ee18f735e4bc8239c937cd0fc5a155747ea1c5aa7e63fe3681b83101d802b997347a1d14601bee524d825bb1a3babb76bc164b7de9a8412c1e3a99806faeb325ad52f69c2bc56d7b74dd36afccfd65a8ab1e4646136624f2e2c6ba\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/12abf8549206dfaeba3a7fd6835be5fa635d14b5a52e81aa3e15f56c714fccbdc2e3093db11ed2c481af80f955ddf57c3dda3cd66151415306d22653c2b5f174a01e4e94a5be1aab07011a6df014cf270337bb9ebffc07122a2dea1b5a5f0dc3e363fdb6076a0f2296ef047b70dc876caa6c4d64c37f108d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0f0176f9fd9f3454afab189557d315e38e2344e2a72afc70a0556d2b6418f2b562b74dd6fa2f852cd937d8dada89d5ca4394ffed29f468bafa0ed24a30c9feb175c5971515e66bdf0f45d3207db772f19a641739a2e475cf071939e4d10529478dc83a24bcd911942396532b42762d4e8b1545a6ca2ce542\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4526fdbc9930ccc69610aec0dba94dd84500458491de98b557ed9ee15f4b7b55817ff5da478b45eed072558e21d27600cbe23b06bdaa42d275ea3dbbb37377d1b0ef817e76671de16eeec822a1eee01c6126bcfdc62b7f53acb09a4c929dce68679c8f83f0a54f7dbdfdd633e7764650b905d8816ee523cc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/57072145212a674fa2b5e3c128c9bd3a03b00df29a40517dc793f58482978b91c471580b18dd4c29fb3a2046e98ba7f55602b2cd49d2ab73911fd6bc75461daef358255efc264d0fb4b05d2482f8dc1af82ce4383dcda8f6c03e3ae203bafadc48ced079ac90760ef6e565a26e2d60ab8c6ae966e1145d89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d8973f94349d1279946620d5c52103ffa02a509841cbada8c2f852e124a6d7a25d9075122897944aeedf66c0f538a51aa5564e4df49c845df7f3b0e087581e5f5edc7e02d2451677318f9cbcba19d6ae61e7454799ae247c04af05d4b6f9199a8a8ae667a5cfb7330e62856ba8691e058d8630716f9ae057\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3251149ce0dc6e068fee35c6a12e828dc00e47ba3d4796edcd60d1fad8d13d24b43c94d99343bb6126bdd6786fcd6c23c628882a5782f28be79854cd8336647713b2acac6e286894b71df9aa6fbc3648509265c28a292a91fe1b55011436c375bcec9af52493d6fba7a5709f8a1d2d8703ab6b1a199dfab5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f9ff3829d88d87513d990965237cab0515fcf36d583d351e8ee42a04484672db4c9f54929b89b53499eac09104acf4243f99002c6212e7c28504623dca317ee4af980e45603e61a9dab977bd70507bcbafdfadbb1cda89531854fe26ed01827c1822108613678202ddda0804709410a7954d3d6dfb38c381\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a457396a9ae602ea4be3df5560f2180c6272f8ecaab2dc7442e1552867c3d89aa9fd394d50cdfe0b7b261f500994ffe61669c4de603ce4eb7f923d5a8095637a64f0bd82c5ef185b120c15ed56f446c9830d8b83b569005fa5269d76df1172fed0294754781a5815f5595aa7504976817b4f4ed51c65027c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/77e6c3bcc7efae7aef380489db6512af972dd3898316a94d6a21ca94d1dcc05e13b55b48fe8d70eecba7ac1c4bcf385754dc6817468cb7da02d9c2336182f8d1b85e522e33b902b8ea14e8ac55df2f894d92e506934b3659572d678328856775355aee8816404c158dbedfa09bbec2aad503f014cad6b072\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c3b68e1eee153f0a40f7e77f3b92848c26e5f153556851275a4da51fbdcbd370f2c9f9a677a2c7c423b463f9a7f30794cfa3a77b98b180590fdee984212918ead1e53a4e5a87067ef2ac7158b0515d278990b1c295548b0d1a105a2d9e15d115a721bc7e266b74eb155738e31765c419a36042900067dcee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/33f9408cbe18946d745d68add77b08dfdeb3ec6a308aa465e23d9389d5e9c003e98cb46033d74d9ee30134040248dd4575dc99c1d74179e55bdcdfa7b522d858e37a84e13dcd9490b440396153edbbfd67fc893c8fd92d10da17cf1d2450a203a74f161819b509896bac5138d178de249ba6d99354807a81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4a175acc7b25fe1a949424fea5a76f785f514f692056faabc43168b5fef8887593a61c87f3cad30dad4db337df18bf9eb478fff25e80873ab775ba98b2353e5cf1b5d05337ca47af05da74eeadf4e685485785c0cf29f83218436ffc89c24620be9f9ac19db7592c346915cd3edd537bde2b9bb977e6d93b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/99f03395ca2ddc5430048fc897862e8bcf1888621c02ffab6d8645a74400661b6ce42e9371e119e04291f5314db7334b2b667dde2f10752b4a8cf8744d831523c6ca0567bb6a30a4d692353200a8c3bd67e6c7ae926ce3fa3802b68c850f658f66c9e89991b446b74b738d6570a2b0d1fa065ba4665628de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b01aa530bb5c057d14ef6d91eaf7693300d7341722f143f1623da7a117e17bce641b76a45dbef463cd5a18f8273f8ee16c1b00e46b001e86acc89059e7f41a3b58e35aa3a631387cee1e491d8353021351ff957c579514ed6c143dba6264fc17599cdfa7a5fef1be36c38a607b0a45f80a77e08ed1bf87e8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/aa64b689238e15e6b2f6529bf26cfc647ddf6f96d2156fee5afc1e3ebe0126e913082762e41e459476045ca1d85ce9b516ef27790ca01b145f0f90200366ceaecc5e2065bf6d37a6828f1cc04cac7601d2376c8214e780ed2305fb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/eafc4c99d12bdd01846f0a5cf582da4d26f19e77e24fc1b02dd6184146360ae670761199e5d3789504e778a94eab21df7ad9231bf27b96ff105c3df7dfd1c1e1f0fc8cbb5b964445f7f62a11f3fe68d0a48b339a8cda5dca27ecc1006b74e55ca89fbb2a21ec8adc60f12b19a18bf664ff34599db1865707\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a9c2ad6740a07aaef113b7ca11744fa969152cd7fef79c41304748ae5482d2e32b37775f9e8a2c623f004ea72deb0c376545f1769ebd8dcea32a77da179483fc37ca69657cf5db848c4543d13db9b00cad17f85f834cad662cfa7917f79a03ba22ebcdc09c41c211ad9914ff832b14aaa0e617e300954627\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/17344e608b8495419df72e18ebd7f6610673a3cdb8b9ba35c3e854747aa9073dda0ef12489bc6c7bba6686071c0fd83ae9fb2a91b6d0591ae927550738e3efa76ace3bffbcc9696f7da72782221228ed07eefb3b3b55c89fea5efe79b3563c559948d5848e9e7768063e73492c5f5deaacdcf421a396d77f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2833b7cafca6e195406cf1e317ae0b6d04406e620d30cb4a858706047c91a7c66733595b5b80cdad7c48c5c693f2233d9ee32fd79aa389df9516f507ff382191200d7599681db029b0e9a28710eda0a1b547b8e8286d68bfd9ad3c8125748ca443047dde7b3e0d6298691f919c48809cce2a194c1755bfd1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/db70f11bcf2d7e7b0a9c12a0386b8ed7fa9e0cf2096170f5cd99b867b70a71f3231c9625348b66944a1a6248c6e26d47f86b3b909fa9a232d15bebde2f6e092f5804b64bee519e1619a5e99f68f051e2d8a9cdbc8f55cdad32e467e8e7a4ce73ae8d42eaf6a9c3dacf8ae140de383f310c055eba52b7755c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/af6b90d1b8e002daea8ae7f8bde34e120c5063a8f738f6a692290a73d56f03ee3b4fcb815c061bd9bec07195cc19c4f84cbb3eded823f279d386c37be89ed767cc4476154fb0a33d9f63fdc5a42bce39532f5be9de45a49bbb3db8007250585d3d2a4e96944ae34f6f478f2951bf3587554a857f635bb795\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8676835ca4d3e1db7a391838167a7d6764207353860f1dab6aa91ad6d452472f3d64eaae84c75ba4603901824d8c0d5ee779f1e038b0a311ca8c456cbb453bbe028ff3ff0fd4b4a0dac2c0bd23121778c78323042742113483e4ff3b46ae71dc786550c8e32fd1664274524eb4faaf3456251a7998f15e32\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
